<title>FRANCE: France to offer 11 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 11 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said it would offer 11 billion francs of bills at its next weekly tender on Monday, December 30.</p>
<p>The offering will comprise eight billion francs of 13-week bills and three billion francs of 48-week paper.</p>
<p>Payment for the 13-week paper is due on January 2. Payment for the 48-week bills is due on January 9.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 54 52</p>
